<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en" data-low-data="<%= user?.preferences?.lowData ? 'true' : 'false' %>"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" name="viewport"/><meta content="Understand payment choices, authorisation and buyer protection in Classic Mart." name="description"/><meta content="#ff6200" name="theme-color"/><title>Payment Policy — Classic Mart</title><link href="/styles.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/storefront-pages.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/shared-shell.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/marketplace-pages.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/info-pages.css" rel="stylesheet"/></head><body class="info-body"><a class="skip-link" href="#mainContent">Skip to content</a><%- include("partials/storefront-header") %><main class="info-main" id="mainContent"><section class="info-hero"><div class="container"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="catalog-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><strong>Payment Policy</strong></nav><span class="info-kicker">Clear and protected checkout expectations</span><h1>Payment Policy</h1><p>Understand payment choices, authorisation and buyer protection in Classic Mart.</p></div></section><div class="container info-content"><section class="policy-stack"><article><h2>Server-authoritative checkout</h2><p>Classic Mart recalculates price, delivery, tax and stock on the server before an order is created. A browser redirect is never accepted as proof of payment.</p></article><article><h2>Payment providers</h2><p>Online payment entry is hosted/tokenized by the configured payment provider. Classic Mart verifies the provider transaction amount, currency, reference and successful state before marking an order paid. Cash on delivery is reconciled after verified delivery.</p></article><article><h2>Refunds</h2><p>Approved online refunds are submitted to the original payment provider and remain pending until provider completion. Every completed refund reverses the corresponding marketplace ledger entries; COD resolutions remain auditable through the same order and support history.</p></article><article><h2>Never share security codes</h2><p>Classic Mart support should never request your full password, card PIN or one-time payment code.</p></article></section></div><% if (typeof cmsContent !== 'undefined' && cmsContent) { %><section class="container info-section" style="margin-top:18px"><article style="border:1px solid #dbe4ef;border-radius:18px;padding:18px;background:#fff"><span class="info-kicker">Managed content · v<%= cmsContent.version %></span><h2><%= cmsContent.title %></h2><p style="white-space:pre-wrap"><%= cmsContent.body %></p></article></section><% } %></main><section class="newsletter">
<div class="container newsletter-inner">
<div class="newsletter-message"><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/envelope.svg"/></span><div><strong>Stay in the Loop!</strong><small>Get exclusive deals, new arrivals and shopping tips.</small></div></div>
<form class="newsletter-form" data-newsletter-form id="newsletterForm" novalidate>
<label class="sr-only" for="newsletterEmail">Email address</label>
<input autocomplete="email" id="newsletterEmail" maxlength="254" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required type="email"/>
<button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
<p aria-live="polite" class="newsletter-status" data-newsletter-status></p>
</form>
<div class="newsletter-perks"><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/percent.svg"/><b>Exclusive Deals</b></span><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/gift.svg"/><b>New Arrivals</b></span><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/location-dot.svg"/><b>Shopping Tips</b></span></div>
</div>
</section><%- include("partials/storefront-footer") %><div aria-live="polite" class="page-toast" id="pageToast" role="status"></div><script src="/cart-store.js"></script>
<script src="/info-pages.js"></script><script src="/shared-shell.js"></script><script src="/image-fallback.js"></script><script src="/country-switcher.js"></script><script src="/search-tools.js"></script><script src="/newsletter.js"></script></body></html>